</section></section><section data-mw-section-id="57" id="mwDco" aria-labelledby="In_popular_culture"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="In_popular_culture">In popular culture</h2></div>
<p id="mwDcs">Paris has been the setting for many movies, TV shows, and other forms of media, including the Netflix streaming series <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emily_in_Paris" title="Emily in Paris" id="mwDcw">Emily in Paris</a> and the kids' animated superhero show <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Miraculous_Ladybug" title="Miraculous Ladybug" class="mw-redirect" id="mwDc0">Miraculous Ladybug</a>.</p>

